-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2609-q18","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2609","source_question_id":"gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2609-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"ef23f8511cd4046899d92b190c77c916f3b3be085a8c4d3f8bf48fe59378d7b3","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）现代科学研究中常用到高速电子，电子感应加速器就是利用感生电场加速电子的设备。如图甲所示，电子在（位于真空室的）圆环形轨道上运动，轨道半径为R，电磁铁产生的磁场方向与环形轨道平面垂直，轨道处的磁感应强度满足 "},{"type":"math","value":"B = B_{0} + \\alpha \\cdot t \\quad (B_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 待求，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"已知且大于零)。t=0时刻电子以速度v进入轨道且恰能做圆周运动，运动方向如图乙所示。轨道内变化磁场产生的感生电场对电子进行加速，加速过程中电子始终不脱离圆轨道。电子在加速器中运动，除了感生电场力和洛伦兹力，不考虑其他作用力，忽略相对论效应。电子质量为m，元电荷为e。\n（1）从图乙的视角看，轨道处磁场方向如何？（说明“向里”或者“向外”）\n（2）求 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的值；\n（3）事实上，加速轨道内的磁感应强度并不是处处相同的。为方便处理，将轨道平面内的磁场用一个匀强磁场 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\overline { { B } }"},{"type":"text","value":" 来等效，其随时间变化关系满足 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\overline{B}=\\overline{B}_{0}+\\beta\\cdot t"},{"type":"text","value":"，\n①求电子在轨道上运动时的切向加速度大小；以及从 "},{"type":"math","value":"t = 0"},{"type":"text","value":" 时刻开始，电子在轨道上加速一周，感生电场力做的功W；\n②若要使电子顺利在加速器内加速， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\beta"},{"type":"text","value":" 和"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"应满足的关系；\n（4）在静电场中，将电荷的电势能与其电量的比值定义为该点的电势。感生电场中能否引入电势的概念？\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9b7a6f0085b6b4f8833994a23d56a604990c6f68d9cdd28518d71b29c74806fd.png","width":278,"height":393,"width_mm":32.509,"row_group":"gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2609-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲 侧视图　乙 真空室俯视图\n第 18 题 图\n\n原卷公共参数：本卷中无特殊说明，重力加速度g均取 "},{"type":"math","value":"1 0 \\, \\mathrm { m } / \\mathrm { s } ^ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【解析】：\n"},{"type":"text","value":"（1）向外"},{"type":"score","value":"（2分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"（2）"},{"type":"math","value":"t=0"},{"type":"text","value":"时"},{"type":"math","value":"B=B_0"},{"type":"text","value":"，根据"},{"type":"math","value":"ev_0B_0=mv_0^2/R"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"B_0=\\frac{mv_0}{eR}"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"（3）①根据法拉第电磁感应定律"},{"type":"math","value":"\\varepsilon=\\frac{\\Delta\\varphi}{\\Delta t}=\\frac{\\Delta\\bar B\\cdot S}{\\Delta t}=\\beta\\cdot\\pi R^2"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"涡旋电场强度"},{"type":"math","value":"E=\\frac{\\varepsilon}{2\\pi R}=\\frac12\\beta R"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"切向加速度"},{"type":"math","value":"a_\\tau=\\frac{eE}{m}=\\frac{e\\cdot\\beta R}{2m}"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"运动一周感生电场力做功"},{"type":"math","value":"W=e\\cdot\\varepsilon=e\\cdot\\beta\\pi R^2"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"②切线方向："},{"type":"math","value":"v=v_0+a\\cdot t"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"法线方向："},{"type":"math","value":"evB=mv^2/R"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"联立"},{"type":"math","value":"v_0+\\frac{e\\beta R}{2m}t=v=\\frac{eR}{m}(B_0+\\alpha\\cdot t)"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"上式对任意时刻"},{"type":"math","value":"t"},{"type":"text","value":"都应成立，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\beta=2\\alpha"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"（4）由定义式"},{"type":"math","value":"\\varphi=E_p/q"},{"type":"text","value":"，而"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta E_p=-W_{\\text{电}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，在感生电场中，电场力做功与路径有关（顺时针、逆时针运动做功不一样，某一点没有确切的电势能），故不能引入电势概念。"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"score","value":"评分标准：第（1）小题2分，第（2）小题2分，第（3）小题4+4分；第（4）小题1分，不说明理由也给分。\n"}]}}]}
